      "writtenOn": "2023-10-02T07:59:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Now that `nonce` is included, what are the constraints on its size?\n\nFor the specific AEAD used here, will this be entirely ignored?\n\nIf different AEADs are allowed in the future, will there need to be a `nonce_size() -\u003e usize` method somewhere to indicate what\u0027s required?\n\n(More generally, I wonder if we can use the Rust type system more to reduce the number of footguns still inherited from BoringSSL...)",
